            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Power Capacity:</strong> 8/20A single module (unlimited for parallel)</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Efficiency:</strong> ≥ 98%</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Compensation Performance:</strong> up to 97%</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Nominal Frequency:</strong> 50/60HZ</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Connection Type:</strong> 3 Phase 3 Wire / 3 Phase 4 Wire</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Installation:</strong> Wall mounted/Rack mounted/Cabinet</p>
            <p><strong class="text-text-dark font-bold">Warranty:</strong> Standard 2 years/negotiable</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Configurator: SKU selector card (header + part-number chip / labelled chips / summary bar) -->
          <div class="mt-[clamp(20px,2vw,32px)] rounded-2xl border border-border-light bg-white overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 pt-5 pb-1">
              <p class="m-0 text-[clamp(16px,1.4vw,22px)] font-bold text-text-dark">Configure your SKU</p>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-border-light bg-[#fafbfc] px-3 py-1.5 text-[14px] whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-text-muted">SKU:</span> <span data-sku-chip-val class="font-semibold text-brand-orange">&mdash;</span></span>
