          <p class="text-text-mid text-[clamp(13px,1.15vw,17px)] leading-relaxed">Direct control, configuration, monitoring and power-quality analysis from the front panel — no PC required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-light p-6">
          <h3 class="text-brand-orange font-semibold mb-2 text-[clamp(15px,1.35vw,22px)]">Comprehensive Measurements</h3>
          <p class="text-text-mid text-[clamp(13px,1.15vw,17px)] leading-relaxed">RMS voltages and currents, power factor before/after, system frequency, load factor and the compensation current the unit is delivering right now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-light p-6">
          <h3 class="text-brand-orange font-semibold mb-2 text-[clamp(15px,1.35vw,22px)]">Power Factor Correction</h3>
          <p class="text-text-mid text-[clamp(13px,1.15vw,17px)] leading-relaxed">Dynamic correction for both lagging and leading power factor without capacitor-step switching.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-light p-6">
          <h3 class="text-brand-orange font-semibold mb-2 text-[clamp(15px,1.35vw,22px)]">Load Balancing</h3>
          <p class="text-text-mid text-[clamp(13px,1.15vw,17px)] leading-relaxed">Balances three-phase systems and relieves neutral current in 3P4W networks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-light p-6">
          <h3 class="text-brand-orange font-semibold mb-2 text-[clamp(15px,1.35vw,22px)]">Low Thermal Loss</h3>
